    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage itself, while the dense carrier continues through the end-to-end flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The low-resolution image is first encoded into a dense feature field. Windowing partitions that field before the thought process reads and updates it. The repeated ticks return to the DQ-CTM stage itself, with shared parameters across ticks. The decoded output comes after the thought updates, not inside the recurrence.",
